          "color": "#ff8a3d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Seething Strike",
      "description": "Each basic attack gives 8% attack speed for 3s, stacking up to 4 times (32%). While fully stacked, every third attack applies your on-hit effects a second time 0.15s later.",
